RlNzQmdtVFNDbUdnX3FHN19j?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"扭虧為盈策略顯示前景，PayPal 提高指引"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-03","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1633917/000163391726000024/pypl-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"At PayPal Holdings, Inc., our mission is to revolutionize commerce globally. Our products are designed to enable digital payments and simplify commerce experiences for consumers and merchants to make selling, shopping, and sending and receiving money simple, personalized, and secure, whether online or in-person.","zh":"在 PayPal Holdings, Inc.，我们的使命是彻底改变全球商业。我們的產品旨在實現數位支付並簡化消費者和商家的商務體驗，使銷售、購物以及匯款和收款變得簡單、個人化和安全，無論是在線上還是面對面。"},{"en":"We operate a global, two-sided network at scale that connects consumers and merchants with 439 million active accounts across approximately 200 markets as of December 31, 2025.","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們經營一個大規模的全球雙邊網路，將消費者和商家與約 200 個市場的 4.39 億活躍帳戶連接起來。"},{"en":"Consumers: We provide consumers with digital wallets and other solutions that allow them to shop and pay with PayPal and Venmo—both online and in-person—manage their finances (including saving and buying and selling cryptocurrencies), and send and receive money between friends and family. When shopping, we offer consumers flexibility in how they pay, which may include a bank account, a PayPal or Venmo account balance, PayPal-branded consumer credit and debit products, other credit and debit cards, certain cryptocurrencies, or other stored value products such as gift cards, and eligible rewards.","zh":"消費者：我們為消費者提供數位錢包和其他解決方案，使他們能夠透過 PayPal 和 Venmo 在線上和親自購物和付款，管理財務（包括儲蓄以及買賣加密貨幣），並在朋友和家人之間發送和接收資金。購物時，我們為消費者提供靈活的支付方式，其中可能包括銀行帳戶、PayPal 或 Venmo 帳戶餘額、PayPal 品牌的消費信貸和借記卡產品、其他信用卡和借記卡、某些加密貨幣或其他儲值產品（例如禮品卡）以及符合條件的獎勵。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The global payments industry is highly competitive, dynamic, innovative, and subject to regulatory scrutiny and oversight. Many of the areas in which we compete evolve rapidly with innovative and disruptive technologies, shifting preferences, needs, and price sensitivity of consumers and merchants, and frequent introductions of new products and services. Competition also may intensify as new competitors emerge, businesses combine or enter into new partnerships, and established companies in other segments expand to become competitive with various aspects of our business.","zh":"全球支付行业竞争激烈、充满活力、创新，并受到监管审查和监督。我們競爭的許多領域隨著創新和顛覆性技術、消費者和商家偏好、需求和價格敏感性的變化以及新產品和服務的頻繁推出而迅速發展。隨著新競爭對手的出現、企業合併或建立新的合作夥伴關係以及其他領域的老牌公司擴張以在我們業務的各個方面具有競爭力，競爭也可能會加劇。"},{"en":"Our business faces competition from a wide range of businesses and from all forms of physical and electronic payments. We face competition from banks and financial institutions, which provide traditional payment methods (particularly credit cards and debit cards (collectively, \"payment cards\"), electronic bank transfers, credit, and installment methods), payment networks that facilitate payments for payment cards or proprietary retail networks, payment card processors, and \"card on file\" services. We also face competition from providers offering a variety of payment products and services ranging from broader platform solutions to point solutions focused on a specific functionality or feature, including tokenized and contactless payment cards, digital wallets and mobile payments solutions, credit, installment or other buy now, pay later methods, real-time payment systems, P2P payments and","zh":"我们的业务面临着来自广泛企业以及各种形式的实物和电子支付的竞争。我們面臨銀行和金融機構的競爭，這些機構提供傳統支付方式（特別是信用卡和金融卡（統稱為「支付卡」）、電子銀行轉帳、信貸和分期付款方式）、促進支付卡或專有零售網路支付的支付網路、支付卡處理商以及「卡存檔」服務。我們也面臨來自提供各種支付產品和服務的供應商的競爭，從更廣泛的平台解決方案到專注於特定功能或特性的單點解決方案，包括代幣化和非接觸式支付卡、數位錢包和行動支付解決方案、信貸、分期付款或其他先買後付方式、即時支付系統、P2P 支付和"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Transaction Revenue","val":29798000000,"zh":"交易收入"},{"name":"Revenues From Other Value Added Services","val":3374000000,"zh":"其他加值服務收入"}],"total":33172000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":18868000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":14304000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":33172000000}},"peers":["XYZ","SHOP","CRM","V","BABA"]}}